bstract format1" data-format=3D"1"><div class=3D"rm rml"><p>Most type syste=
ms are designed to verify safety properties: the
judgement <span class=3D"" data-katex-src=3D"e : \tau"><span class=3D"katex=
"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/M=
